# Comment before the action definition
define the potential action<mv:define-lang.org:test_files:/valid/action_with_comments_in_block> {
    define the position<my_pos>.
    it happens when { # comment after open brace
        the position<my_pos> has a particle.
    } and it does {
        define the position<_noop>.
        create a particle in position<_noop>.
    } # comment after close brace
}
